  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the scene as an observer of a market day",
  "description": "The user is not explicitly projected onto any specific visual, textual, or scene element through deictic pronouns like 'me', 'you', or 'your'. However, the user is implicitly projected onto the overall scene ('market_day_scene') as an observer or participant in the cultural context of a local market. The meme invites the user to interpret the scene through the lens of the overlaid text 'market day', which categorizes the visual material. The user is thus projected onto the scene as someone who understands or is expected to recognize the cultural or economic activity depicted.",
